            "line": 1231,
            "text": "noncomputable def regularAngularLag (h : ℝ) (f U V : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  (∫ x in (0 : ℝ)..p.1, (2 * x * f (x, p.2)) * Sq h f U V (x, p.2)) /\n    (p.1 * (2 * p.1 * f p))"
